+// EXCLUDING the SM's own dispatched validation lane (event
+// workflow_dispatch — validate_pr owns re-dispatching that, a rerun here
+// would race it). Newest cancelled run PER workflow path only: the
+// watchdogs are stateless, the newest run recomputes and re-stamps the
+// current state — re-running every burst corpse burns runners for the
+// same stamps.
